Linking SDL

g++ main.cpp -o lacrose -L./dep/sdl -lSDL3

breakdown 
	g++ 		: the compiler to use
	main.cpp 	: the file that needs to be compiled
	-o lacrose  : the output file is named as "lacrose"
	-L./dep/sdl : Locatoion is ./dep/sdl
	-lSDL3 		: "libSDL3", "-l" is resolved to "lib", and linker is smart enough to autocomplete